# Warmaker Gunship: the trigger targets only a creature an opponent controls - Bot1's own Memnite is refused, Bot2's Wall of Stone and Ornithopter are choices. Bot1
# controls the Gunship, Memnite and three Moxen (five artifacts), so Ornithopter (0/2) dies and Bot2's own artifact does not matter. One charge counter (Memnite's power
# one) leaves it a plain artifact: no creature, no flying, no power.

